#: prefs.js
msgid "Smart Top Bar"
msgstr "Sandar sama mai hankali"

#: prefs.js
msgid "Shake twice at the top edge to reveal"
msgstr "Motsa hagu da dama sau biyu a gefen sama don nunawa"

#: prefs.js
msgid "Hide when maximized or tiled. Never reveal in true fullscreen."
msgstr "Ɓoye idan an faɗaɗa tagogi ko an jera su gefe da gefe. Kada a nuna a cikakken allo na gaske."

#: prefs.js
msgid "Keep the pointer within 3 pixels of the primary screen’s top edge and move left and right twice."
msgstr "Riƙe mai nuni cikin piksel 3 daga gefen sama na babban allo, sannan motsa hagu da dama sau biyu."

#: prefs.js
msgid "Stroke distance"
msgstr "Nisan kowane motsi"

#: prefs.js
msgid "Logical pixels; larger values reduce accidental reveals."
msgstr "Piksel na ma’ana; ƙima mai girma tana rage bayyana ba da gangan ba."

#: prefs.js
msgid "Gesture time limit"
msgstr "Iyakacin lokacin motsi"

#: prefs.js
msgid "Milliseconds to complete all four alternating strokes."
msgstr "Milisekan don kammala motsi huɗu masu sauyawa."

#: prefs.js
msgid "Hide delay"
msgstr "Jinkirin ɓoyewa"

#: prefs.js
msgid "Milliseconds after leaving; open menus and keyboard navigation keep the bar visible."
msgstr "Milisekan bayan fita; buɗaɗɗun menu da amfani da madannai suna barin sandar a bayyane."

#: prefs.js
msgid "Shortcut: Super + Ctrl + B"
msgstr "Gajeriyar hanya: Super + Ctrl + B"

#: prefs.js
msgid "Reveal or hide temporarily. Disabled in true fullscreen; press Super to use the overview."
msgstr "Nuna ko ɓoye na ɗan lokaci. Ba ya aiki a cikakken allo na gaske; danna Super don dubawa."
